Côte d'Ivoire,Workforce & Human Capital,IIE Announces 2026/27 Centennial Fellowship Cohort to Advance Responsible AI from Framework to Deployment,https://www.iie.org/news/iie-announces-2026-27-centennial-fellowship-cohort-to-advance-responsible-ai-from-framework-to-deployment/,IIE,21 Oct 2026,,no,"NEW YORK, October 21, 2026 — The Institute of International Education (IIE) is pleased to announce the recipients of the 2026/27 IIE Centennial Fellowship, which recognizes Fulbright alumni whose work is advancing the responsible development and use of super intelligence/artificial intelligence.","Created in 2019 to commemorate IIE’s centennial year, the Fellowship enhances the Fulbright Program as a lifelong experience and supports alumni who are applying their expertise to address pressing global challenges. The 2026/27 Fellowship theme, “Advancing Responsible AI: From Framework to Deployment,” focuses on the critical next step in the evolution of AI: translating responsible AI principles into practice across the lifecycle of systems, from design and development to deployment and commercialization.","This year’s cohort includes four IIE Centennial Fellows, who will each receive a $25,000 award, and one IIE New Leader Award recipient, a recent Fulbright alum who will receive $15,000. Together, they represent multiple disciplines, sectors, and regions united by a commitment to ensuring AI technologies are developed and deployed in ways that benefit society.",yes,no,4,6
