Liberia,Governance,West Africa: Ecowas Seeks Closer Ties With Sahel States - As Foreign Minister Nyanti Chairs Ecowas Council,https://allafrica.com/stories/202610190106.html,allAfrica.com,19 Oct 2026,,no,"- Joint teams to negotiate cooperation deal after Burkina Faso, Mali, Niger exit","The Economic Community of West African States (ECOWAS) and the Confederation of Sahel States (AES) have agreed to establish joint working groups to negotiate a cooperation deal, in a move to protect cross-border trade, security collaboration and other regional ties strained by the withdrawal of Burkina Faso, Mali and Niger from ECOWAS.","The agreement was reached on Saturday in Dakar, Senegal, at the first ministerial meeting of the ECOWAS-AES Dialogue on Cooperation, with both sides committing to technical discussions towards a framework that would safeguard their respective interests.",yes,no,1,9
