Burundi,Governance,"Burundi : Ndadaye assassinated, justice unfinished, 2027 presidential election contested: Frodebu raises his voice",https://www.sosmediasburundi.org/en/2026/10/22/burundi-ndadaye-assassinated-justice-unfinished-2027-presidential-election-contested-frodebu-raises-his-voice/,SOS Médias Burundi,22 Oct 2026,,no,"Bujumbura, October 21, 2026 —Thirty-three years after the assassination of Melchior Ndadaye, Burundi’s first democratically elected Hutu president, the Sahwanya Frodebu party is still demanding that all those responsible for this crime be identified and condemned. The political party also announces that it will not present a candidate in the presidential election of May 2027, considering that the guarantees of transparency and inclusiveness of the electoral process are not met.","Through these two positions, the former president’s party calls into question, on the one hand, a justice system that it considers unfinished and, on the other hand, the conditions in which the next presidential election must take place.","“Thirty-three years have passed without justice being fully served,” declared Phénias Niyigaba, vice-president of Sahwanya Frodebu.",yes,no,4,6
