Gambia,Workforce & Human Capital,"MRC Gambia opens doors to communities, inspires future scientists",https://thepoint.gm/africa/gambia/national-news/mrc-gambia-opens-doors-to-communities-inspires-future-scientists,The Point Newspaper,22 Oct 2026,,no,"The Medical Research Council Unit The Gambia at the London School of Hygiene & Tropical Medicine (MRCG at LSHTM) has reaffirmed its commitment to scientific excellence, transparency and community engagement as it welcomed hundreds of community members, students, government officials and international partners to its annual Open Day.","Held at the Unit's headquarters and field sites, the event provided visitors with a unique opportunity to gain first-hand insight into the institution's research activities, engage with scientists and explore how medical research is improving lives in The Gambia and beyond.","Speaking on behalf of the Unit, Dr Davis Nwakanma, Chief Operating Officer, emphasised the critical role that community participation and trust play in the success of scientific research.",yes,no,5,5
