Guinea-Bissau,Macroeconomy,"Gambia's rice cheaper than Senegal, Liberia, Guinea, Minister Bah claims",https://thepoint.gm/africa/gambia/headlines/gambias-rice-cheaper-than-senegal-liberia-guinea-minister-bah-claims,The Point Newspaper,21 Oct 2026,,no,"Lands Minister Hamat Bah says a bag of rice in The Gambia is cheaper than in Senegal, Guinea-Conakry, Liberia, Sierra Leone and Guinea-Bissau, insisting the Barrow government has cut living costs despite public outcry.","Speaking in Banjul on October 19 at the final meeting of President Barrow's Meet the People Tour, Bah said rice prices have fallen from D2,200 to between D1,650 and D1,700 due to government interventions.","""There is a message circulating that cost of living is high. There are some things Gambians must know,"" he said.",yes,no,3,7
