Malawi,Macroeconomy,"Energy transition, Africa’s pathway to economic sovereignty",https://www.theafricareport.com/404539/africas-energy-africas-terms-decarbonisation-cannot-mean-de-industrialisation/,The Africa Report,20 Oct 2026,,no,"During the Annual Meetings of the World Bank in Washington in October 2025, at COP30 in Belém, Brazil, in November, and at the G20 in Johannesburg shortly thereafter, the fight against climate change once again dominated the global agenda.","The central challenge for Africa was to defend its specific circumstances in these international forums, to avoid rules designed elsewhere and ill-suited to its realities.","Drawing on my experience at Afreximbank, where I witnessed first-hand the impact of policies designed far from our realities on our financing and development capabilities, I recognise the importance of this battle for the recognition of Africa’s uniqueness.",yes,no,4,11
