Senegal,Governance,Mahama calls for renewed ECOWAS–Sahel Security Cooperation at London Summit,https://www.modernghana.com/news/1539096/ghanas-president-mahama-calls-for-new-west-africa.html,Modern Ghana,22 Oct 2026,,no,President John Dramani Mahama has called for a new regional security arrangement to strengthen cooperation among West African countries and improve the continent's collective response to insecurity.,"He made the call on Saturday, October 24, 2026, when he presented the 2026 State of Peace and Security in Africa Report at the 12th Tana High-Level Forum on Security in Africa in Bahir Dar, Ethiopia.","The report, which covers the period from January 2025 to June 2026, examines political and economic conditions contributing to conflicts and insecurity across the continent.",yes,no,5,5
