Chad,Digital Economy,Delaware Fire School Deputy Director Chad Ingram Selected for National Firefighter Safety Initiative,https://news.delaware.gov/2026/10/23/delaware-fire-school-deputy-director-chad-ingram-selected-for-national-firefighter-safety-initiative/,State of Delaware News (.gov),23 Oct 2026,,no,"DOVER, DELAWARE — The Delaware State Fire School is proud to announce that Deputy Director Chad Ingram has been selected by the Board of the North American Fire Training Directors (NAFTD) to represent the organization on a national firefighter safety research initiative led by the National Association of State Fire Marshals (NASFM) .","The grant-funded initiative, conducted in partnership with the National Fallen Firefighters Foundation (NFFF) , will examine firefighter line-of-duty deaths and serious injuries, with particular attention to the role of firefighter training and preparedness.","The project will bring together fire service training professionals, researchers, and data experts to examine training records associated with serious incidents, identify potential gaps and emerging training needs, and develop practical recommendations to improve firefighter safety nationwide.",yes,no,0,10
