West African Economic and Monetary Union,Digital Economy,Francophone Leaders Seek Unified Rules to Cut Africa’s Cross-Border Payment Costs,https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/12/francophone-leaders-seek-unified-rules-to-cut-africas-cross-border-payment-costs/,THISDAYLIVE,21 Oct 2026,,no,"Business leaders across Francophone West Africa have called for harmonised regulations, improved access to settlement infrastructure and sustained engagement between regulators and industry players to address the high cost and inefficiencies of cross-border payments in Africa.","The call was made at the Francophone Africa Leaders Forum on Enabling Cross-Border Payments, held in Abidjan, Côte d’Ivoire, on July 22, 2026.","The forum brought together 11 chief executives and senior representatives from institutions involved in banking, payment networks, financial infrastructure, fintech and payment services.",yes,no,0,10
