Sierra Leone,Macroeconomy,"Integrity, character vital for sustainable economic growth – Coleman MD",https://punchng.com/integrity-character-vital-for-sustainable-economic-growth-coleman-md/,Punch Newspapers,25 Oct 2026,,no,"The Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer of Coleman Technical Industries Limited, Mr George Onafowokan, has stressed that integrity, character and discipline remain the ultimate foundation for building sustainable businesses and driving long-term economic development.","Delivering the keynote address at the inaugural Pan-Atlantic University Alumni Association International Conference, themed ‘The Advantage: Connecting People, Ideas and Opportunities,’ held at the Ecobank Pan African Centre in Lagos, Onafowokan outlined vision, focus, discipline, integrity and good character as essential principles for professional and corporate success.","“Integrity is your biggest weighted gold, not your car, not your house, not your land. Build it from the day you start your life. The entitlement mentality is the greatest killer of integrity. When you build character and integrity, you derisk yourself, and doing business or leading people becomes seamless,” Onafowokan asserted.",yes,no,0,14
