Zimbabwe,Governance,Is Benjamin Netanyahu the root cause of Israel's abysmal public relations record?,https://www.jpost.com/business-and-innovation/article-912781,The Jerusalem Post,24 Oct 2026,,no,"A group of 109 economists, business leaders, high-tech entrepreneurs, and former senior public officials issued a strongly worded statement expressing ""deep anxiety and concern"" over Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu's conduct, warning of irreversible damage to Israel's economy if international sanctions are imposed.","The letter followed an interview in which Netanyahu made clear that he was not concerned about sanctions, said that US military aid ""is not something that will last forever and will eventually end,"" and revealed that he had requested a plan to circumvent banking sanctions using cryptocurrencies and blockchain technology.","""The prime minister's remarks demonstrate a fundamental lack of understanding and ignorance in the face of Israel's collapsing standing in the international arena,"" the 109 signatories charged in their letter. ""Netanyahu is knowingly leading the State of Israel toward an international economic boycott and isolation, and all he has to offer is a bizarre solution commonly used by criminal organizations that will be of no help whatsoever.""",yes,no,3,7
