Niger,Agrifood & Climate,"Tinubu’s Current East-West Road Decision Could Transform Niger Delta, Says Ugolor",https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/17/tinubus-current-east-west-road-decision-could-transform-niger-delta-says-ugolor/,THISDAYLIVE,25 Oct 2026,,no,"The Publisher of the ‘Common Good Letter’ , Rev. David Ugolor, has commended President Bola Ahmed Tinubu’s directive that the continuing Lagos–Calabar Coastal Highway be aligned with sections of the existing East–West Road in the Niger Delta.","He maintained that the directive, if properly designed, transparently financed and effectively implemented, could become one of the most consequential infrastructure decisions affecting the Niger Delta under the present administration.","Rev. Ugolor, in a statement issued yesterday stated that a safe and durable East–West Road would connect communities, reduce transport costs, strengthen regional trade, support agriculture and industry, attract investment and save lives.",yes,no,2,8
