Niger,Workforce & Human Capital,"NDDC, UNIPORT partner to promote Niger Delta creative industry",https://punchng.com/nddc-uniport-partner-to-promote-niger-delta-creative-industry/,Punch Newspapers,21 Oct 2026,,no,The Niger Delta Development Commission says it is collaborating with the University of Port Harcourt to build the capacity of people in the Niger Delta by promoting the growth of the creative industry and advancing sustainable development in the region.,"Speaking during a four-day technical training programme on film production for filmmakers in the Niger Delta, held at the university’s Theatre Arts and Film Studies auditorium, the NDDC Head of New Media in the Corporate Affairs Department, Dr Selina Dan-Albert, said the commission was continually exploring opportunities to empower young people and equip them with relevant skills to thrive in the creative industry.","This was contained in a statement issued in Port Harcourt on Wednesday by the NDDC Director of Corporate Affairs, Seledi Thompson-Wakama, and sent to journalists.",yes,no,5,9
