Somalia,Governance,Libya Protests Remarks by Donald Trump Regarding Nation’s Status,https://www.khabaragency.net/news254860.html,وكالة خبر للأنباء,26 Oct 2026,,no,The Libyan Ministry of Foreign Affairs summoned the United States chargé d'affaires on Sunday to formally protest disparaging remarks made by former President Donald Trump during a campaign rally in Georgia.,"During the event, Trump characterized Libya, Yemen, Haiti, and Somalia as nations allegedly infested with terrorism, further labeling them using derogatory language. In response, the Libyan ministry issued a statement categorically rejecting any rhetoric that undermines the dignity or standing of its people, expressing profound condemnation of the former president’s characterization of the country.","The diplomatic backlash has transcended Libya’s internal political divisions, with both competing authorities in the eastern and western regions of the country issuing unified condemnations. Both factions rejected the inclusion of Libya in American electoral discourse, signaling a rare consensus in opposition to the remarks.",yes,no,4,6
