Western Sahara,Jobs & Employment,"UN Adopts Guterres’s Final Report on the Moroccan Sahara, Recommending MINURSO Extension to October 2027 and Real Autonomy",https://fesnews.media/322978/2026/10/25/,Fes News Media,25 Oct 2026,,no,"alfahmed1981 October 25, 2026 Breaking News , English , International , Morocco , Morocco , World , World News 0 Views","FES NEWS MEDIA – UNITED NATIONS (NEW YORK): The United Nations has officially adopted the final version of Secretary-General António Guterres’s report on the Moroccan Sahara without introducing any substantive changes, including a formal recommendation to extend the mandate of the United Nations Mission for the Referendum in Western Sahara ( MINURSO ) for an additional year, until October 31, 2027 .","In the final report submitted to the Security Council, the UN Secretary-General warned that the absence of MINURSO would lead to a sharp rise in the risk of escalating hostilities , amid persistent field tensions and the ongoing impasse in reaching a definitive political settlement to the regional dispute.",yes,no,1,9
